    {
      "name": "broadsheet",
      "type": "registry:item",
      "title": "Broadsheet Pattern",
      "description": "The editorial Landing/archive pattern: masthead, lead article, numbered entry list, and post-header kicker. Entry numerals are generated from `data-entry-number` via `attr()`, never `counter()`, and every kicker/dateline row is the label voice: tracked capitals, because the default mono face has no small caps (`font-variant-caps: all-small-caps` only on a face with `smcp` + `c2sc`; remarque-audit checks).",
