      "name": "skip-link",
      "type": "registry:item",
      "title": "Skip Link (chrome.css)",
      "description": "The first focusable element in <body>: `.remarque-skip-link` targets `<main id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\">`, visually hidden by clip-path (never an off-screen offset) until focused, then a filled fg-on-bg block on `--z-skip-link`. Ships with `.remarque-sr-only`. Shares chrome.css with the breadcrumb, pager and tags items.",
